# Text files are LF in the repository and in every checkout, Windows
# included, whatever core.autocrlf says. A Windows checkout then matches the
# WSL one and the Cloudflare build byte for byte: the gallery data records
# each sketch's size, the site serves the files as they are, and a CRLF
# shebang breaks build_gallery.py if this checkout is run from WSL.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The committed renders.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
